<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ro">
<head>
    <%- include("../fragmente/head", {
        titluPagina: "4Pets | Pet shop pentru animale de companie",
        descrierePagina: "4Pets este un pet shop pentru animale de companie, cu hrana animale, accesorii animale si jucarii animale pentru ingrijire responsabila."
    }) %>
</head>
<body>
    <%- include("../fragmente/header") %>

    <main>
        <section id="despre" class="zona-grid zona-1">
            <h2>Despre 4Pets</h2>
            <p class="accent-poster"><i class="fa-solid fa-paw icon-static" aria-hidden="true"></i> Hrana, accesorii si recomandari pentru animale de companie ingrijite responsabil.</p>
            <p>La <b>4Pets</b>, fiecare <b>animal de companie</b> primeste recomandari practice pentru <b>hrana animale</b>, <b>accesorii animale</b>, <b>jucarii animale</b> si <b>ingrijire animale</b>.</p>
            <p>In acest <b>pet shop</b> ne bazam pe date din <i>veterinary nutrition</i> si pe principii <i>grain-free</i> doar atunci cand sunt justificate de medicul veterinar.</p>
            <p><strong>Anunt important:</strong> in perioada 2-20 martie 2026, stocul pentru unele jucarii animale este limitat, iar recomandarile de ingrijire animale sunt actualizate zilnic.</p>
            <p>Pentru un catel activ, termenul de livrare nu este deloc <em>instant</em>, dar ramane previzibil si comunicat clar.</p>
            <p>Am <s>oprit complet pachetele combo</s> <ins>extins pachetele combo pentru hrana animale si accesorii animale</ins> pentru clienti noi.</p>

            <article id="misiune">
                <h3>Misiune si standarde</h3>
                <blockquote cite="https://www.fediaf.org/">
                    O alimentatie corecta sustine sanatatea fiecarui animal de companie.
                </blockquote>
                <p>Urmarim un echilibru intre pret, calitate si siguranta, iar termenul <dfn>palatabilitate</dfn> descrie cat de usor accepta animalul hrana recomandata.</p>

                <section id="glosar">
                    <h4>Glosar scurt</h4>
                    <p>Prescurtarea <abbr title="hrana uscata premium">HUP</abbr> apare in oferta noastra pentru hrana animale cu retete complete.</p>
                    <dl>
                        <dt>Accesorii animale</dt>
                        <dd>Produse pentru confort zilnic: lese, castroane, culcusuri si genti de transport.</dd>
                        <dt>Jucarii animale</dt>
                        <dd>Produse pentru stimulare mentala si activitate fizica, adaptate speciei si varstei.</dd>
                    </dl>
                    <p>Citat client: <q>Este singurul pet shop unde gasesc constant hrana animale potrivita pentru varsta catelului meu.</q></p>
                    <p>Recomandam lucrarea <cite>Nutrition and Management of Companion Animals</cite> pentru lectura suplimentara.</p>
                </section>
            </article>
        </section>

        <section id="produse" class="zona-grid zona-2">
            <h2>Tabel produse populare</h2>
            <div class="container-tabel">
                <table>
                    <caption>Produse populare in pet shop-ul 4Pets</caption>
                    <thead>
                        <tr>
                            <th scope="col">Produs</th>
                            <th scope="col">Categorie</th>
                            <th scope="col">Pret</th>
                            <th scope="col">Stoc</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Royal Canin Adult</td>
                            <td>Hrana animale</td>
                            <td>129 lei</td>
                            <td>Disponibil</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Whiskas Sterile</td>
                            <td>Hrana animale</td>
                            <td>82 lei</td>
                            <td>Disponibil</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Lesa reglabila</td>
                            <td>Accesorii animale</td>
                            <td>49 lei</td>
                            <td>Disponibil</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Minge interactiva</td>
                            <td>Jucarii animale</td>
                            <td>39 lei</td>
                            <td>Disponibil</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td colspan="2">Pachet combo hrana + accesorii</td>
                            <td>159 lei</td>
                            <td rowspan="2">Stoc limitat</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Pat premium</td>
                            <td>Accesorii animale</td>
                            <td>219 lei</td>
                        </tr>
                    </tbody>
                    <tfoot>
                        <tr>
                            <td colspan="3">Total produse in campanie</td>
                            <td>26</td>
                        </tr>
                    </tfoot>
                </table>
            </div>

            <p>
                Descarca oferta PDF:
                <a href="/resurse/documente/oferta-4pets.pdf" download="oferta-4pets-descarcata.pdf">download oferta 4Pets</a>
            </p>
        </section>

        <section id="calendar" class="zona-grid zona-3 placeholder">
            <h2>Calendar evenimente</h2>
            <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Sed viverra, arcu id feugiat rutrum, sem mi rutrum urna, vitae tempor risus mi nec erat.</p>
        </section>

        <section id="anunturi" class="zona-grid zona-4 placeholder">
            <h2>Anunturi</h2>
            <p><i class="fa-solid fa-bone icon-animated" aria-hidden="true"></i> Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Integer in sapien vel magna porta fermentum.</p>
        </section>

        <section id="online" class="zona-grid zona-5 placeholder">
            <h2>Utilizatori online</h2>
            <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Praesent porttitor leo at risus luctus, non aliquet nisi porta.</p>
        </section>

        <section id="statistici" class="zona-grid zona-6 placeholder">
            <h2>Date utilizator si statistici</h2>
            <p>IP utilizator: <strong><%= ipUtilizator %></strong></p>
            <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Suspendisse nec ipsum quis mauris eleifend gravida.</p>
        </section>

        <section id="server" class="zona-grid zona-7 placeholder">
            <h2>Date site si server</h2>
            <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Curabitur luctus diam nec neque ultrices, nec volutpat sem posuere.</p>
        </section>

        <section id="diverse" class="zona-grid zona-8">
            <h2>Ghid si resurse 4Pets</h2>

            <aside id="linkuri-utile">
                <h3>Linkuri utile</h3>
                <p>
                    Resursa externa:
                    <a href="https://www.purina.ro/articole/caini/nutritie" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ghid Purina pentru nutritie canina</a>
                </p>
                <p>
                    Link extern catre element cu id:
                    <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Reference/Elements/a#technical_summary">
                        https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Reference/Elements/<wbr>a#technical_summary
                    </a>
                </p>
            </aside>

            <section id="imagine">
                <h3>Imagine reprezentativa</h3>
                <figure>
                    <picture>
                        <source media="(max-width: 600px)" srcset="/resurse/imagini/site/peggy-small.jpg">
                        <source media="(max-width: 1024px)" srcset="/resurse/imagini/site/peggy-medium.jpg">
                        <img src="/resurse/imagini/site/peggy-large.jpg" alt="Caine fericit in magazinul 4Pets" title="Client 4Pets multumit" width="768" height="940">
                    </picture>
                    <figcaption>Imagine din magazin: clienti cu animale de companie, hrana animale si accesorii animale in zona principala.</figcaption>
                </figure>

                <p>
                    <a href="/resurse/imagini/site/peggy-large.jpg">
                        <img src="/resurse/imagini/site/peggy-small.jpg" alt="Click pentru varianta mare a imaginii" width="240" height="294">
                    </a>
                    (la click, imaginea mare se deschide in tabul curent)
                </p>

                <h4>Harta de imagine</h4>
                <p>Alege zona dorita pentru navigare rapida.</p>
                <img src="/resurse/imagini/site/picture_map.png" alt="Harta interactiva a sectiunilor din pagina" usemap="#harta-4pets" width="640" height="360">
                <map name="harta-4pets">
                    <area shape="rect" coords="0,0,213,180" href="#produse" alt="Zona produse">
                    <area shape="rect" coords="213,0,426,180" href="#calendar" alt="Zona evenimente">
                    <area shape="rect" coords="426,0,640,180" href="#faq" alt="Zona intrebari frecvente">
                    <area shape="rect" coords="0,180,320,360" href="#video" alt="Zona video">
                    <area shape="rect" coords="320,180,640,360" href="#contact" alt="Zona contact">
                </map>
            </section>

            <section id="evenimente">
                <h3>Evenimente 4Pets</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li><time datetime="2026-03-05T12:00">5 martie 2026, ora 12:00</time> - <b>Pachet de bun venit</b> - oferim mostre de hrana animale in limita stocului.</li>
                    <li><time datetime="2026-03-12T17:30">12 martie 2026, ora 17:30</time> - <b>Sesiune de recomandari</b> - prezentam accesorii animale pentru catei juniori.</li>
                    <li><time datetime="2026-03-20T11:00">20 martie 2026, ora 11:00</time> - <b>Ziua jocului</b> - testam jucarii animale interactive cu clienti voluntari.</li>
                </ul>

                <p>
                    Confirmari atelier (valoare mica):
                    <meter value="18" min="0" max="100" low="30" high="80" optimum="65">18 din 100</meter>
                </p>
                <p>
                    Trafic sambata (valoare mare):
                    <meter value="91" min="0" max="100" low="30" high="80" optimum="65">91 din 100</meter>
                </p>
            </section>

            <section id="faq">
                <h3>Intrebari frecvente</h3>
                <details>
                    <summary>Ce hrana animale recomandati pentru pui?</summary>
                    <p>Alegerea se face dupa varsta, talie si nivel de activitate, plus recomandarea medicului veterinar.</p>
                </details>
                <details>
                    <summary>Exista garantie pentru accesorii animale?</summary>
                    <p>Da, majoritatea produselor au garantie comerciala intre 30 si 90 de zile.</p>
                </details>
                <details>
                    <summary>Pot returna jucarii animale nefolosite?</summary>
                    <p>Da, in 14 zile, cu ambalaj intact si documentul de achizitie.</p>
                </details>
            </section>

            <section id="video">
                <h3>Video YouTube</h3>
                <div class="container-iframe">
                    <iframe
                        name="cadru-video"
                        width="560"
                        height="315"
                        src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/M7lc1UVf-VE?autoplay=0&amp;controls=1&amp;rel=0"
                        title="Videoclip YouTube despre ingrijire animale"
                        allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"
                        allowfullscreen>
                    </iframe>
                    <div class="taburi-iframe">
                        <a href="https://www.youtube.com/embed/jNQXAC9IVRw?si=def456" target="cadru-video">Ingrijire</a>
                        <a href="https://www.youtube.com/embed/aqz-KE-bpKQ?si=ghi789" target="cadru-video">Accesorii</a>
                        <a href="https://www.youtube.com/embed/M7lc1UVf-VE?si=abc123" target="cadru-video">Recomandari</a>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <h4>Playlist YouTube automat</h4>
                <iframe
                    width="560"
                    height="315"
                    src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/jNQXAC9IVRw?autoplay=1&amp;mute=1&amp;controls=1&amp;loop=1&amp;playlist=jNQXAC9IVRw,aqz-KE-bpKQ,M7lc1UVf-VE"
                    title="Playlist YouTube 4Pets"
                    allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"
                    allowfullscreen>
                </iframe>
            </section>

            <section id="formula">
                <h3>Formula MathML</h3>
                <p>Pentru estimarea necesarului energetic zilnic folosim formula standard RER.</p>
                <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block">
                    <mrow>
                        <mi>RER</mi>
                        <mo>=</mo>
                        <mn>70</mn>
                        <mo>&#x00D7;</mo>
                        <msup>
                            <mi>W</mi>
                            <mn>0.75</mn>
                        </msup>
                    </mrow>
                </math>
                <p>Unde <i>W</i> este greutatea animalului in kilograme.</p>
            </section>

            <section id="pdf">
                <h3>Brosura PDF</h3>
                <object data="/resurse/documente/oferta-4pets.pdf" type="application/pdf" width="700" height="500">
                    <p>Browserul nu poate afisa PDF-ul. Deschide fisierul aici:
                        <a href="/resurse/documente/oferta-4pets.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Brosura 4Pets</a>.
                    </p>
                </object>
            </section>
        </section>
    </main>

    <%- include("../fragmente/footer") %>
</body>
</html>
